WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.900
CaveRace is back.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.700
Explore the caves, collect the treasure,
and blast your way through the underground.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.200
But choose your path carefully.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.200
One wrong move can be your last.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:18.500
Twenty-five cool levels of cave action await you.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.500
Enter the caves with CaveRace 2!

